    m_Localized: Plant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715577
    m_Localized: Restore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715578
    m_Localized: 'Rules: on'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715579
    m_Localized: 'Rules: off'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715580
    m_Localized: "Pressure sensor {0} kPa  \xB7  Level {1} %  \xB7  PPE {2} of {3}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715581
    m_Localized: '<color=#FF5A4A>ALARM: high pressure</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715582
    m_Localized: '<color=#FF5A4A>ALARM: low level</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715583
    m_Localized: '<color=#FF5A4A>EXPLOSION. Cause: {0}.</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715584
    m_Localized: clog
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715585
    m_Localized: low level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715586
    m_Localized: pump failure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715587
    m_Localized: exhaust fan failure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715588
    m_Localized: faulty pressure gauge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715589
    m_Localized: A fault will occur within a minute. Watch the instruments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715590
    m_Localized: 'Practice fault: {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715591
    m_Localized: The plant is restored. Start it on the Control page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715592
    m_Localized: There is no such fault.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715593
    m_Localized: Stop the plant first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715594
    m_Localized: Lock the breaker at the control post first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715595
    m_Localized: Put on the PPE from the stand first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715596
    m_Localized: The fault is fixed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715597
    m_Localized: Remove the lock and start the plant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715598
    m_Localized: Refilling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715599
    m_Localized: Correct the setting. {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715600
    m_Localized: "Soda at 5 \xB0C: crystallisation, clog"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715601
    m_Localized: "Gas 14 m\xB3/s with liquid 0.01 m\xB3/s: too little irrigation, deposits"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715602
    m_Localized: "Pump 1 with liquid 0.1 m\xB3/s: the pump cannot keep up"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715603
    m_Localized: "Pump 1 with plant gas from 400,000 m\xB3/h: the pump is too weak"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715604
    m_Localized: Press to learn more
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715605
    m_Localized: Press to put on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715606
    m_Localized: Worn. Press to take off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715607
    m_Localized: Press to lock the breaker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715608
    m_Localized: Locked. Press to remove the lock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715609
    m_Localized: Stop the plant first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715610
    m_Localized: Gas inlet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715611
    m_Localized: Contaminated gas enters here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715612
    m_Localized: Pump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715613
    m_Localized: Feeds liquid from the tank to the column nozzles. Power is set by a level from 1 to 4.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715614
    m_Localized: Gas outlet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715615
    m_Localized: Cleaned gas leaves here for the exhaust fan and the stack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715616
    m_Localized: Pressure gauge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715617
    m_Localized: Pressure in the column. Normal is 2.5 kPa, the red zone starts at 6 kPa, and at 10 kPa the column bursts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715618
    m_Localized: Emulsifier column
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715619
    m_Localized: The main vessel. Gas rises from the bottom and mixes with the liquid, and contaminants pass into it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715620
    m_Localized: Level gauge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715621
    m_Localized: Liquid level. At the lower red mark, water stops reaching the column.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715622
    m_Localized: Exhaust fan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715623
    m_Localized: 'Creates draught: it pulls gas through the whole plant and sends it to the stack.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715624
    m_Localized: Tank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715625
    m_Localized: The supply of liquid that the pump feeds to the column.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715626
    m_Localized: Hard hat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715627
    m_Localized: Safety goggles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715628
    m_Localized: Respirator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715629
    m_Localized: Gloves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715630
    m_Localized: 'PPE: put on before entering'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715631
    m_Localized: 'DANGER ZONE

      Enter only with PPE'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715632
    m_Localized: Breaker lock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715633
    m_Localized: 'LOCK

      off'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715634
    m_Localized: 'LOCK

      on'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715635
    m_Localized: ON
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715636
    m_Localized: OFF
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715637
    m_Localized: '<b>Training</b>: step-by-step prompts and practice faults.

      <b>Exam</b>: no prompts, a fault starts without warning, and you get a score at the end.

      Both modes reset the plant settings and remove your PPE.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715638
    m_Localized: A scenario is running. The task is shown above the tablet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715639
    m_Localized: Step {0} of {1}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715640
    m_Localized: <color=#6FDC8C>Done</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715641
    m_Localized: 'Point the ray at any part of the plant: a frame appears. Press the trigger to open its description.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715642
    m_Localized: Go to the PPE stand. Grab the hard hat, goggles and respirator and bring them to your head and face. Put the gloves on with the ray and trigger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715643
    m_Localized: 'Control tab: choose the liquid Soda.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715644
    m_Localized: On the same tab, set the pump to level 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715645
    m_Localized: "Go to the manual control post and use the valve to set the liquid flow to 0.10 m\xB3/s."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715646
    m_Localized: Start the plant with the breaker at the post.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715647
    m_Localized: 'Look at the smoke: it gets lighter at the column outlet. The plant must run with at least {0} % cleaning.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715648
    m_Localized: 'Practice fault. Watch the pressure gauge: the pressure is rising. Wait for the alarm.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715649
    m_Localized: 'Pressure is above normal: this is a clog. Stop the plant and lock the breaker with the red lock at the post.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715650
    m_Localized: 'Faults tab: press Clean.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715651
    m_Localized: Remove the lock and start the plant again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715652
    m_Localized: 'A new fault. Watch the level gauge: the level is dropping. Wait for the alarm.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715653
    m_Localized: 'The level is below minimum. Faults tab: press Refill.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715654
    m_Localized: Refilling. Wait until it is normal; if the plant is stopped, start it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715655
    m_Localized: 'Pump failure: the jets in the column are gone, the pump sound has stopped, and pressure is rising. Stop the plant and lock the breaker.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715656
    m_Localized: 'Faults tab: press Repair pump.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715657
    m_Localized: 'Exhaust fan failure: the smoke is gone, the fan hum has stopped, and pressure is rising. Stop the plant and lock the breaker.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715658
    m_Localized: 'Faults tab: press Repair fan.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715659
    m_Localized: The gauge shows a rise, but there is no siren and the sensor on the Faults tab is normal. The instrument is faulty. Stop the plant and lock the breaker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715660
    m_Localized: 'Faults tab: press Replace gauge.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715661
    m_Localized: 'Exam: follow the safety procedure, start the plant with at least {0} % cleaning, and watch the instruments.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715662
    m_Localized: '<b>Training complete.</b>

      You can now take the exam: there are no prompts, and a fault starts without warning.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715663
    m_Localized: '<color=#FF5A4A><b>Explosion.</b></color> Pressure reached the burst point while the plant was running.

      Start the training again: stop the plant as soon as the alarm sounds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715664
    m_Localized: '<color=#6FDC8C><b>Pass: {0} of 100</b></color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715665
    m_Localized: '<color=#FF5A4A><b>Fail: {0} of 100</b></color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715666
    m_Localized: 'Explosion: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715667
    m_Localized: 'Not fixed in time: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715668
    m_Localized: 'Reached normal operation: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715669
    m_Localized: not achieved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715670
    m_Localized: 'Fault "{0}": reaction {1}, fixed in {2}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715671
    m_Localized: "{0}: \u2212{1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715672
    m_Localized: '{0} s'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715673
    m_Localized: '{0} min {1} s'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715674
    m_Localized: Wrong setting. {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715675
    m_Localized: Slow reaction to a fault
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715676
    m_Localized: Late reaction to a fault
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715677
    m_Localized: Entered the danger zone without PPE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715678
    m_Localized: Started the plant without PPE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715679
    m_Localized: Tried to fix a fault that did not exist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715680
    m_Localized: Servicing a running plant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715681
    m_Localized: Servicing without locking the breaker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420715682
    m_Localized: Servicing without PPE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16855863996416
    m_Localized: Grab it and bring it to your head
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16855893356544
    m_Localized: Grab it and bring it to your face
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
